    "html": "<p>A projectile is launched with a velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"u\"></span> at an angle <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span> to the horizontal. It reaches a maximum height <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"s\"></span>. What is the time taken to reach the maximum height?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2s}{u cos \\theta}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2s}{g}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{u cos \\theta}{g}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{u sin \\theta}{g}\"></span></li></ol>"
